{"answer":"I can build it, but need a few details first. Your recorded activity has mostly been short walks (10 of 13 recorded sessions over 90 days; median 20 minutes), and you recently reported exhaustion after moving house, so I would start conservatively. [bdde09ee-e21] [bdde09ee-context]

What is your main goal for the month? Which days can you train, for how long, and which days are unavailable? What equipment do you have, and besides swimming, what activities do you enjoy or want to avoid?

